#. ja: イシュガルディアン・モーニングセット
#. de: Portion[p] Ishgarder Frühstück
#. fr: petit déjeuner ishgardais
#. column 2: alpine breakfasts
#. column 8: A simple but hearty breakfast oft supped upon by Temple Knights before taking their morning tilts.<br><br>※Cannot be retrieved once used.<br>※Can be used up to 10 times.<br><br>Meal benefits when used:<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Tenacity Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +4% (Max 28)<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>VIT Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +4% (Max 27)<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Gear Durability Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>EXP Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3%<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30m<br>  (Duration can be extended to 60m by consuming multiple servings)
#. column 9: Alpine Breakfast
msgctxt "Item:15146:0:0"
msgid "alpine breakfast"
msgstr "альпийский завтрак"

#. de: Portionen[p] Ishgarder Frühstück
#. fr: petits déjeuners ishgardais
#. column 0: alpine breakfast
#. column 8: A simple but hearty breakfast oft supped upon by Temple Knights before taking their morning tilts.<br><br>※Cannot be retrieved once used.<br>※Can be used up to 10 times.<br><br>Meal benefits when used:<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Tenacity Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +4% (Max 28)<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>VIT Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +4% (Max 27)<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Gear Durability Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>EXP Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3%<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30m<br>  (Duration can be extended to 60m by consuming multiple servings)
#. column 9: Alpine Breakfast
msgctxt "Item:15146:0:2"
msgid "alpine breakfasts"
msgstr "альпийские завтраки"

#. ja: イシュガルド様式の朝食セット<br>[1回以上消費後に撤去すると消滅する]<br><br>食事効果（最大10回）:<br>  不屈 +4%（上限28）<br>  VIT +4%（上限27）<br>  装備消耗耐性 +3<br>  敵討伐・製作・採集時経験値獲得量 +3%<br>  効果時間 30:00 [最大2倍まで効果時間の継ぎ足し可能]
#. de: Ein ausgewogenes Frühstück bestehend aus Salat, Suppe, Toast mit Ei, einem Stück Fleisch und Früchten. (Kann nach der ersten Anwendung nicht mehr ins Inventar zurückgelegt werden. 10 Anwendungen möglich.)<br>Wirkung bei Verzehr:<br>Unbeugsamkeit + 4 % (max. 28)<br>Konstitution + 4 % (max. 27)<br>Haltbarkeit von Ausrüstung + 3<br>Erhöht die Routine im Kampf, bei der Synthese und beim Sammeln.<br>Routine-Bonus +3<nbsp>%<br>Dauer: 30 Minuten<br>(Kann durch wiederholten Verzehr auf bis zu 60 Minuten verlängert werden.)
#. fr: Un copieux petit déjeuner de style ishgardais, avec pain, œuf, salade et soupe chaude.<br>[L'objet disparaît s'il est retiré après consommation]<br>Effets du repas (jusqu'à 10 fois)<nbsp>:<br> Ténacité +4% (max 29)<br> Vitalité +4% (max 27)<br> Résistance à l'usure +3<br> Points d'expérience gagnés +3% (bonus appliqué aux éliminations d'ennemis, aux synthèses et aux récoltes)<br> Durée d'effet<nbsp>: 30 minutes (cumulable jusqu'à 60 minutes)
#. column 0: alpine breakfast
#. column 2: alpine breakfasts
#. column 9: Alpine Breakfast
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <ui-color 504> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 504 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 505> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 505 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Item:15146:0:8"
msgid "A simple but hearty breakfast oft supped upon by Temple Knights before taking their morning tilts.<br><br>※Cannot be retrieved once used.<br>※Can be used up to 10 times.<br><br>Meal benefits when used:<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Tenacity Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +4% (Max 28)<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>VIT Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +4% (Max 27)<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Gear Durability Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>EXP Bonus:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3%<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Duration:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30m<br>  (Duration can be extended to 60m by consuming multiple servings)"
msgstr "Простой, но сытный завтрак, которым подкрепляются храмовники перед утренними турнирами.<br><br>※После использования предмет нельзя забрать обратно.<br>※Можно использовать до 10 раз.<br><br>Эффекты от еды:<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Бонус к стойкости:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +4% (макс. 28)<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Бонус к физической мощи:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +4% (макс. 27)<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Бонус к прочности экипировки:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Бонус к опыту:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> +3%<br>  <ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Длительность:</ui-edge-color></ui-color> 30 мин.<br>  (Можно продлить действие до 60 мин., съев несколько порций.)"

