#. de: Aquarium[p] S
#. fr: aquarium de petite taille
#. column 2: tier 1 aquariums
#. column 8: A circular glass tank that, when filled with water, can serve as a home for select wavekin caught in the wild. The higher an aquarium's tier, the larger the specimens that can be kept within.<br>※Private chambers (apartments), cottages, houses, and mansions can hold 4, 6, 8, and 10 aquariums, respectively.
#. column 9: Tier 1 Aquarium
