#. column 8: A small coin of low denomination once used in the long-fallen nation of Mhach. There are four Mhachi farthings in a penny. Once actively sought by numismatists across Eorzea, the market soon became oversaturated, causing this ancient currency to lose its value entirely.
#. column 9: Mhachi Penny
msgctxt "Item:15947:0:0"
msgid "Mhachi penny"
msgstr "мелкая монета Мхача"

