#. column 2: pairs of jumbo sheep dolls
#. column 8: Two stuffed sheep─husband and wife─dressed in traditional Far Eastern garb. The difference in size with normal sheep dolls is indiscernible to all but the most observant.
msgctxt "Item:15998:0:9"
msgid "Jumbo Sheep Dolls"
msgstr "Огромные овечки-куклы"

